{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118431","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118431/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118431/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118431/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118431","id":4246079100,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79FgZ8","number":118431,"title":"XMLParser::close() calls memdelete_arr(data) instead of memdelete_arr(data_copy)","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T00:21:08Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:04Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev (commit 1aabcb9e9b)\n\n### System information\n\nN/A — code correctness issue, affects all platforms.\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn `core/io/xml_parser.cpp`, the `close()` method calls `memdelete_arr(data)` instead of `memdelete_arr(data_copy)`:\n\n**`close()` at line 537-548:**\n```cpp\nvoid XMLParser::close() {\n    if (data_copy) {\n        memdelete_arr(data);       // BUG: should be data_copy\n        data_copy = nullptr;\n    }\n    data = nullptr;\n    ...\n}\n```\n\n**The destructor at line 554-558 does it correctly:**\n```cpp\nXMLParser::~XMLParser() {\n    if (data_copy) {\n        memdelete_arr(data_copy);  // Correct\n        data_copy = nullptr;\n    }\n}\n```\n\nCurrently, this is benign because whenever `data_copy` is non-null, `data` equals `data_copy` (set in `open()` and `open_buffer()`). However, the inconsistency with the destructor is a maintenance hazard — if the relationship between `data` and `data_copy` ever changes, or if `_open_buffer()` is called to set `data` to an external pointer while `data_copy` is non-null, this would free the wrong memory or cause a double-free.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Call `XMLParser::open()` or `XMLParser::open_buffer()` to load XML data.\n2. Call `XMLParser::close()`.\n3. Observe that `data` is freed instead of `data_copy` (currently works by coincidence since `data == data_copy`).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — simple code correctness issue visible from comparing `close()` with the destructor.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118431/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}